          \"metadata\": {}
        },
        \"create_time\": 1767029727.012353,
        \"update_time\": null,
        \"content\": {
          \"content_type\": \"text\",
          \"parts\": [
            \"Exactly. Any claim about what’s “inside” the particle is inferred from the behavior we can observe. The model represents a mapping that’s consistent with experimental data, but it isn’t the particle itself—it’s a structured interpretation, constrained and shaped by the limits of measurement.\"
          ]
        },
