        "create_time": 1767029670.317295,
        "update_time": null,
        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Take a particle. A classical point particle. Its properties can be probed, but not directly examined apart from position/velocity (subject to Heisenberg), and its observable dynamical behavior is essentially just a mapping of its trajectory in time. That means that any intrinsic properties are inferred and mathematically mapped in order to extract a model that, if done right, isomorphically maps internal properties to outward behavior and mathematical structure. The map is not the territory, but it acts as a proxy for the territory, subject to experimental constraints. With me so far?  "
          ]
        },
        "status": "finished_successfully",
        "end_turn": null,
        "weight": 1,
        "metadata": {
          "dictation": false,
          "request_id": "a70df18b-dfde-4188-ab66-a6343bf49651",
          "message_source": null,
          "turn_exchange_id": "beea138a-cd1f-4381-b881-125ad2cbfbf1",
          "can_save": false
        },
        "recipient": "all",
        "channel": null
      },
      "parent": "client-created-root",
      "children": [
        "be86b7da-6f26-4061-845b-ea9a7986a074"
      ]
    },
    "be86b7da-6f26-4061-845b-ea9a7986a074": {
      "id": "be86b7da-6f26-4061-845b-ea9a7986a074",
      "message": {
        "id": "be86b7da-6f26-4061-845b-ea9a7986a074",
        "author": {
          "role": "assistant",
          "name": null,
          "metadata": {}
        },
        "create_time": 1767029670.619888,
        "update_time": null,
        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Yes, I’m with you. You’re setting up a distinction between the particle itself—its “territory”—and the models we build from its observable behavior, which serve as proxies constrained by what we can measure. Go on."
          ]
        },
        "status": "finished_successfully",
        "end_turn": true,
        "weight": 1,
        "metadata": {
          "finish_details": {
