          "metadata": {}
        },
        "create_time": 1767029726.66276,
        "update_time": null,
        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "So. Any statement about internal structure or intrinsic properties is, at best, a mathematical model. "
          ]
        },
        "status": "finished_successfully",
        "end_turn": null,
        "weight": 1,
        "metadata": {
          "dictation": false,
          "request_id": "786bcc5c-4054-43ee-90aa-7c4e2f935a33",
          "message_source": null,
          "turn_exchange_id": "5155e6fc-7ce2-4b58-ac29-a9364d98f758",
          "can_save": false
        },
        "recipient": "all",
        "channel": null
      },
      "parent": "be86b7da-6f26-4061-845b-ea9a7986a074",
      "children": [
        "93228199-247f-44b0-84bb-d69497a50bfb"
      ]
    },
    "93228199-247f-44b0-84bb-d69497a50bfb": {
      "id": "93228199-247f-44b0-84bb-d69497a50bfb",
      "message": {
        "id": "93228199-247f-44b0-84bb-d69497a50bfb",
        "author": {
          "role": "assistant",
          "name": null,
          "metadata": {}
        },
        "create_time": 1767029727.012353,
        "update_time": null,
        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Exactly. Any claim about what’s “inside” the particle is inferred from the behavior we can observe. The model represents a mapping that’s consistent with experimental data, but it isn’t the particle itself—it’s a structured interpretation, constrained and shaped by the limits of measurement."
          ]
        },
        "status": "finished_successfully",
        "end_turn": true,
        "weight": 1,
        "metadata": {
          "finish_details": {
