        "update_time": null,
        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Now… considering the outwardly observable behavior is its trajectory… What we’re talking about is a four dimensional worldline. Any mathematical representation of the morphology of that line is a direct mapping of the forces acting upon that particle from the outside (and perhaps some of the internal properties of the particle, to a level of resolution precisely equal to your level of observational capacity and mathematical modeling skill). Correct?  "
          ]
        },
        "status": "finished_successfully",
        "end_turn": null,
        "weight": 1,
        "metadata": {
          "dictation": false,
          "request_id": "2028e869-2099-47ed-87b2-6b3e8886a200",
